  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "The text 'this is why we shoot you guys' maps onto the police officer's friendly demeanor.",
  "description": "The meme uses the juxtaposition of the police officer's smiling, approachable appearance with the threatening text 'this is why we shoot you guys' to create an analogical mapping. The text implies that the officer's demeanor or presence is the justification for lethal force, thereby mapping the officer's visual persona onto the concept of being a reason for shooting civilians. This mapping is ironic and jarring, as the officer's benign expression contrasts with the violent message, suggesting that his friendly appearance is the cause of the threat.",
